      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1610 - Ishaq ibn Ammar asked him (Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as)) about young lambs: \"When does Zakat become obligatory on them?\"\nImam (as) replied: \"When they reach the age of jadha' (when they shed their baby teeth).\""
        ]
